#atlas-ui 1
// Showcase of every layout feature of the screen renderer: synthetic example, not a real system.
## screens: id | title | purpose | opts
SCR-DASH | 总览 | 汇总各项数字，并列出最近的记录。 | kind=page frame=desktop route=/dash start=true group=main req=RQ-1
SCR-FORMX | 登记表 | 平板上居中的登记表单，含各种输入。 | kind=page frame=tablet route=/form group=main
SCR-PHONE | Phone view | A narrow screen where texts and buttons must wrap. | kind=page frame=phone route=/phone group=main
SCR-ALIGN | 对齐 | 屏幕的 align 选项把根下的控件靠右。 | kind=page frame=desktop route=/align group=extra align=end
## variants: screen | name | note | opts
SCR-DASH | loading | 读取数字和记录。 | kind=loading
SCR-DASH | empty | 还没有任何记录。 | kind=empty text=没有记录
SCR-DASH | error | 读取失败，请稍后再试。 | kind=error
SCR-FORMX | error | 有两项没有填写。 | kind=error
SCR-PHONE | loading | Waiting for the server. | kind=loading
SCR-PHONE | empty | Nothing to show yet. | kind=empty
## widgets: local | label | opts
@set screen=SCR-DASH
bar | 页头 | kind=header
logo | 总览 | kind=heading parent=bar
home | 首页 | kind=link parent=bar
help | 帮助 | kind=link parent=bar
menu | 侧栏 | kind=sidebar
m1 | 记录 | kind=menu parent=menu
m2 | 设置 | kind=menu parent=menu
title | 今日概况 | kind=heading
cards | 数字卡片 | kind=row
c1 | 订单 | kind=card parent=cards
c1h | 订单 128 | kind=heading parent=c1
c1t | 比昨天多 12 单 | kind=text parent=c1
c2 | 库存 | kind=card parent=cards
c2h | 库存 3,420 | kind=heading parent=c2
c2t | 有 4 个品种低于安全库存线 | kind=text parent=c2
c3 | 提醒 | kind=card parent=cards
c3h | 提醒 7 | kind=heading parent=c3
c3b | 查看 | kind=button parent=c3 emph=secondary
tags | 标签 | kind=grid cols=3
g1 | 新 | kind=badge parent=tags
g2 | 待处理 | kind=badge parent=tags
g3 | 已完成 | kind=badge parent=tags
g4 | 暂停 | kind=badge parent=tags emph=muted
tools | 工具栏 | kind=toolbar
t1 | 筛选 | kind=button parent=tools
t2 | 导出 | kind=button parent=tools emph=primary
t3 | 删除 | kind=button parent=tools emph=danger
sw | 只看今天 | kind=switch parent=tools
recent | 最近的记录 | kind=table w=fill data={"cols":["编号","客户","金额","状态"],"rows":[["A-1001","张三","120.00","已付"],["A-1002","李四","88.50","待付"],["A-1003","王五","45.00","已付"],["A-1004","赵六","300.00","待付"],["A-1005","钱七","18.20","已付"],["A-1006","孙八","77.70","已付"],["A-1007","周九","9.90","待付"]]}
open | 打开选中的记录 | kind=button emph=primary
stats | 统计表 | kind=table w=fill
pager | 第 1 页 | kind=pagination
chart | 近 7 天走势 | kind=chart w=fill
pic | 示意图 | kind=image
blank | 自定义区块 | kind=custom
line | 分隔 | kind=divider
foot | 页脚 | kind=footer
fnote | 版权所有 | kind=text parent=foot
@set screen=SCR-FORMX
form | 登记表单 | kind=form
hd | 登记新客户 | kind=heading parent=form
nm | 姓名 | kind=input parent=form bind=name
ct | 联系方式 | kind=select parent=form bind=contact
ad | 地址 | kind=textarea parent=form bind=address
ag | 我已阅读并同意以上条款，并愿意接收相关的通知和提醒信息 | kind=checkbox parent=form bind=agree
r1 | 个人 | kind=radio parent=form bind=type
r2 | 公司 | kind=radio parent=form bind=type
err | 还有两项没有填写 | kind=text parent=form in=error emph=danger
acts | 操作 | kind=row parent=form
ok | 提交 | kind=button parent=acts emph=primary
no | 取消 | kind=link parent=acts
side | 说明 | kind=card w=fill
st | 提交后会在两个工作日内审核，请保持电话畅通。 | kind=text parent=side
@set screen=SCR-PHONE
bar | Top bar | kind=header
back | Back | kind=link parent=bar
hd | A rather long heading that has to wrap onto several lines | kind=heading
body | This paragraph is long enough to need several lines on a narrow phone screen, so the renderer wraps it. | kind=text
nm | Your name | kind=input bind=name
go | Continue with the registration of a new customer | kind=button emph=primary
btns | Actions | kind=row
b1 | One | kind=button parent=btns
b2 | Two | kind=button parent=btns
b3 | Three | kind=button parent=btns
b4 | Four | kind=button parent=btns
list | Items | kind=list
li1 | First item | kind=text parent=list
li2 | Second item | kind=text parent=list
@set screen=SCR-ALIGN
note | 靠右的说明文字 | kind=text
act | 靠右的按钮 | kind=button emph=primary
mid | 居中的说明文字 | kind=text align=center
## nav: from | to | label | opts
SCR-DASH.home | SCR-DASH | 刷新首页 | on=tap
SCR-DASH.m1 | SCR-FORMX | 去登记 | on=tap
SCR-DASH.open | SCR-FORMX | 打开记录 | on=tap guard=已选中一条记录 req=RQ-1
SCR-DASH.recent | SCR-PHONE | 看手机版 | on=tap
SCR-FORMX.ok | SCR-DASH | 提交成功 | on=submit
SCR-FORMX.ok | SCR-FORMX#error | 提交失败 | on=submit alias=nav-form-fail
SCR-FORMX.no | SCR-DASH | 取消登记 | on=tap
SCR-PHONE.back | SCR-DASH | 返回 | on=back
SCR-PHONE.go | SCR-PHONE#empty | 继续 | on=tap
SCR-ALIGN.act | SCR-DASH | 回到总览 | on=tap
